{
  "Combat.Akbal.Attack.Blocked": "Akbal lunges forwards but with your toughness he fails to deal any damage."
  "Combat.Akbal.Attack.Heavy": "Akbal snarls as he flies towards you, snapping his ivory teeth on your arm. You scream out in pain as you throw him off."
  "Combat.Akbal.Attack.HeavyBlocked": "Akbal lunges forwards but between your toughness and armor, he fails to deal any damage."
  "Combat.Akbal.Attack.Miss": "Akbal lunges, but you slip aside."
  "Combat.Akbal.Attack.Normal": "Akbal rushes at you, his claws like lightning as they leave four red-hot lines of pain across your stomach."
  "Combat.Akbal.Heal.Full": "Akbal licks himself, ignoring you for now."
  "Combat.Akbal.Heal.Wounded": "Akbal licks one of his wounds, and you scowl as the injury quickly heals itself."
  "Combat.Akbal.Lust.First": "You hear whispering in your head. Akbal begins speaking to you as he circles you, telling all the ways he'll dominate you once he beats the fight out of you."
  "Combat.Akbal.Lust.FirstFierce": "You begin to hear whispering in your head, and Akbal's ethereal voice cuts through your mind. [say: You are in my way, submit now or I will make it very painful for you when I finish what I'm doing.]"
  "Combat.Akbal.Lust.Repeat": "The whispering in your head grows, many voices of undetermined sex telling you all the things the demon wishes to do to you. You can only blush."
  "Combat.Akbal.Lust.RepeatFierce": "The whispering in your head grows, many voices of undetermined sex telling you all the things the demon wishes to do to you."
  "Combat.Akbal.Special.Fire": "Akbal releases an ear-splitting roar, hurling a torrent of emerald green flames towards you."
  "Combat.Akbal.Special.FireDamage": "You are burned badly by the flames! ({0} damage)"
  "Combat.Akbal.Special.FireDodged": "You narrowly avoid Akbal's fire!"
  "Combat.Akbal.Special.FlamePenalty": "The ground he scorched remains consumed in flames! You've got a bit less room to maneuver now."
  "Combat.Akbal.Special.Speed": "Akbal's eyes fill with light, and a strange sense of fear begins to paralyze your limbs."
}
